The moe theme's faces (~/.config/themes/moe/). All SIL Open Font License 1.1.

Rounded Mplus 1c (M PLUS Rounded 1c) -- the UI face (theme.conf font=).
    A rounded gothic with full Japanese (kana, kanji), so Japanese and Latin
    match. Regular, Medium, Bold.
    Source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/mplusrounded1c
    (M+ FONTS PROJECT / Coji Morishita). Licence: OFL-MPLUS.txt (the M+
    families share it).

M PLUS 1 Code -- the terminal face (term.font=, font_mono=).
    Monospace with Japanese (wide glyphs two cells: fontconfig "dual").
    Google ships it as ONE variable font, MPLUS1Code[wght].ttf; COSMIC
    Terminal lists a family only if it has a Regular AND a Bold face, and
    its font library sees a variable font as one face -- so the two files
    here are static instances cut from it with fontTools
    (varLib.instancer: wght 400 -> MPLUS1Code-Regular.ttf, 700 ->
    MPLUS1Code-Bold.ttf; names set to "M PLUS 1 Code" Regular / Bold). The
    variable original is NOT in this folder (fontconfig would list its
    instances twice). Modified versions under the same OFL.
    Source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/mplus1code
    Licence: OFL-MPLUS.txt

Hachi Maru Pop (はちまるポップ) -- headings and little touches: the bar's
    clock, the cards' headings, the launcher's hero name, mpv's 一時停止中 ♡.
    A playful handwritten pop face (Nonty). Regular only.
    Source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/hachimarupop
    Licence: OFL-HachiMaruPop.txt

